<li>Set the technical direction for modernizing a legacy .NET Framework MVC application to .NET 10, with C#/ASP.NET Core Web APIs and React/TypeScript interfaces on SQL Server.</li>
<li>Led event-storming and DDD implementation sessions, and designed the DDD/CQRS workflow and rule-builder capabilities across aggregates, APIs, persistence, UI, and end-to-end testing.</li>
<li>Led a coordinated modernization path toward Azure App Service: runtime configuration, Entra integration, Key Vault identity, parallel pipelines, staging validation, and rollback planning.</li>
<li>Guide a team of 10 developers through design decisions, architecture reviews, and code reviews, and drove the decision to keep end-to-end tests in the repository instead of a separate suite; codified standards in a CLAUDE.md reference guide with a reference vertical slice.</li>
<li>Modernized CI/CD and test workflows, including Playwright-based regression coverage, cutting pipeline time from 40–60 minutes to 19 minutes.</li>
<li>Supported a product-line transition involving catalog identity, component modeling, pricing, drawings, indexing, and administrative tooling.</li>
<li>Uses Claude Code for implementation, refactoring, testing, and legacy-code work, validating changes against domain rules, architecture boundaries, tests, and review. Also built <a href="https://conorbrown.orangecastle.net/projects/mega-desk">Mega Desk</a>, an internal agent harness (Claude Agent SDK, Codex CLI, Azure DevOps) that teammates use daily.</li>
</ul>
<h3>IXOPAY <span>June 2021–April 2025</span></h3><p class="role">Senior Software Engineer</p><ul>
<li>Built payment-related microservices including a containerized Card Account Updater to address subscription churn caused by expiring payment credentials.</li>
<li>Engineered asynchronous API usage telemetry with Azure Service Bus and a 99.9% delivery SLA for billing-related data; the SLA covered billing and revenue for the whole company and its enterprise customers.</li>
<li>Introduced integration-test infrastructure and secure runtime configuration patterns across cloud services.</li>
</ul>
<h3>MissGroup / Hostek <span>January 2014–June 2021</span></h3><p class="role">Software Engineer</p><ul>
<li>Rebuilt web-hosting management workflows with .NET Web APIs, React, and an orchestration/gateway layer.</li>
<li>Designed remote infrastructure and deployment tooling operating across 2,000+ Windows servers, including IIS, firewall, certificate, and service management.</li>
<li>Built secure credential management and remote access functionality supporting controlled sharing.</li>
</ul></section>
<section><h2>Technical breadth</h2><p><strong>Backend and architecture:</strong> C#, .NET Framework and .NET 10, ASP.NET Core / Web API, MVC, Entity Framework Core, DDD, CQRS, Clean Architecture, event-driven design, event storming, microservices and modular monoliths, legacy modernization.</p><p><strong>Cloud and platform:</strong> Azure App Service, Azure Service Bus, Key Vault, App Configuration, Docker, Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions, observability.</p><p><strong>Product and data:</strong> Blazor WASM, React, TypeScript, React Native/Expo, SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Cosmos DB, query/index tuning, Playwright, xUnit, NUnit, and integration testing.</p><p><strong>AI development:</strong> Claude Code, Claude Agent SDK, Codex CLI, custom agent tooling, CLAUDE.md context conventions, agent workflows, prompt context, code review and validation.</p></section>
<section><h2>Independent products and certification</h2><p><strong>Pathway:</strong> software engineering education platform · <strong>Theoria:</strong> interactive music education platform. Project walkthroughs: <a href="https://conorbrown.orangecastle.net/projects">https://conorbrown.orangecastle.net/projects</a>.</p><p><strong>Certified Scrum Developer</strong> — Scrum Alliance</p></section>
